ction turbine therefore suits medium and low pressure. Both cause-and-effect explanations are correct.\",\n      \"Per-choice explanations: every wrong term is named correctly. (1): only (ア) is wrong. (2): all five terms are wrong. (3): (ア), (ウ) and (オ) are wrong; (イ) and (エ) are correct. (4): (イ), (ウ), (エ) and (オ) are wrong; (ア) is correct. (5): every term is correct. None of these explanations misses a wrong term, and none marks a correct term as wrong.\",\n      \"Figures: the original page has no figure, only the combination table. figureUrls and choiceFigureUrls are both empty, and the table is fully reproduced in the choice text, so no figure is needed.\",\n      \"Sources: officialReferenceUrls is empty, and the explanation makes no claim that would need an external official reference. Its content is standard steam-turbine principle and can be checked against the problem's own logic. sourceAttribution (令和6年度下期, 電力科目, 問3) is consistent with examDate 2025-03-23, fiscalYear 2024, term lower and subject power. The attached image carries printed page -3-, and reviewedFromPage [6] is consistent with it once the cover and instruction pages are counted.\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15776,"cache_read_input_tokens":139443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15776},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8cadf6be-0eca-481d-8905-d55be3a5e9e1","uuid":"ee2934a6-3052-46fa-9e22-6a7c36986e9a","timestamp":"2026-09-24T08:58:36.687Z","request_id":"req_011CfMzGFGk2LDuKB9xArSxE"}
